  "citation": "JAFAROV E; Clark J; Piliouras A; Tape K; Jones B; Rowland J (2021): The LAKE model input dataset for three Arctic lakes. Interdisciplinary Research for Arctic Coastal Environments (InteRFACE). Dataset. doi:10.15485/1808368",
